bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Chapter commenting 1

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Form (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
control UserService
entity ":CommentModel" as CommentModel
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

CommentService -> UserService: 1. find user
activate CommentService
activate UserService

UserService -> UserModel: 2. findById(userId)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 3. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 4. return user data
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 5. return user data
deactivate UserModel

UserService --> CommentService: 6. return user data
deactivate UserService

CommentService -> CommentService: 7. Check user
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

opt Invalid user
    CommentService --> CommentController: 7.1. Throw error
    activate CommentController
    CommentController --> Router: 7.2. 401 Unauthorized
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Show error
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 7.4. Show error
    activate User
end

CommentService -> CommentService: 8. Validate chapter_id
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

opt Invalid chapter_id
    CommentService --> CommentController: 8.1. Throw error
    CommentController --> Router: 8.2. 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 8.4. Show error
end

CommentService -> CommentModel: 9. Create new comment
activate CommentModel
CommentModel -> MongoDB: 10. save comment
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CommentModel: 11. Saved comment
deactivate MongoDB
CommentModel --> CommentService: 12. savedComment
deactivate CommentModel

CommentService -> CommentService: 13. Check save result
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

opt Failed to save comment
    CommentService --> CommentController: 13.1. Throw error
    deactivate CommentService
    CommentController --> Router: 13.2. 500 Internal Server Error
    deactivate CommentController
    Router --> UI: 13.3. Show error
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 13.4. Show error
    deactivate UI
    deactivate User
end